Appendix C — Proofs for the Transfer-Cost Bounds

C.1 Theorem 2 (simulation lemma with reward and visited-distribution mismatch)

Theorem 2. Let \psi_{ij}:\mathcal X_i\to\mathcal X_j be a measurable bijection with measurable inverse, and suppose \epsilon_R=\sup_{x,u}|r_i(x,u)-r_j(\psi_{ij}x,\psi_{ij}u)|<\infty. Then

